draft: DRAFT-libxdp-1.6.3-ohos-xdp-tests-unrunnable
status: pending-editor-review
id: DRAFT-libxdp-1.6.3-ohos-xdp-tests-unrunnable
title: OHOS 上 XDP/AF_XDP 上游测试不可执行的三条并列判据（无 bpffs / SELinux 拒 netlink / BPF 执行 EPERM）
trigger_tool: ip|mount|make
phase: testing
error_signature: Unable to mount /sys/fs/bpf|can.t talk to rtnetlink: Permission denied|Operation not permitted
severity: 2
category: platform, kernel, testing
match_keywords: /sys/fs/bpf, bpffs, mount -t bpf, rtnetlink, ip link add, veth, Operation not permitted, EPERM, XDP, AF_XDP, bpf syscall, SELinux, test_xdp_devbound, test_xsk
root_cause: XDP/AF_XDP 类上游测试需要三项内核能力——挂 bpffs、建 veth(rtnetlink)、加载 BPF 程序；OHOS 内核未提供 bpffs/BPF syscall，SELinux 又拒绝 netlink 与 BPF 程序执行，故分别报 Unable to mount /sys/fs/bpf、ip: can t talk to rtnetlink: Permission denied、Operation not permitted(126)。
affected_scope: 所有在 OHOS 上跑 XDP/eBPF/AF_XDP 上游测试套件的项目（xdp-tools/libxdp、libbpf、bpftool 等）
verification_cmd: sudo env DID_UNSHARE=1 PATH=... make -C lib/libxdp test V=1 2>&1 | grep -E "Unable to mount /sys/fs/bpf|rtnetlink: Permission denied|Operation not permitted"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: declare-environment-blocked
rec_description: 按 R51 逐条如实申报"环境阻塞"并附原始报错，不写 PASS、不为凑数改上游测试；把"可执行子集"（如纯编译+链接检查）与"环境阻塞"分开列，并注明非适配缺陷。
rec_command: grep -E "Unable to mount /sys/fs/bpf|rtnetlink: Permission denied|Operation not permitted" ~/libxdp-upstream.log
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: docs
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: substitution-test-package
fallback_description: 用不依赖内核能力（无 BPF syscall/bpffs/netlink）的消费者 test_package 验证库的非 syscall 面（ELF/BTF 解析、对象管理、错误路径），并在 notes 标注"适配完整性需人工确认"。
fallback_command: conan create . -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: test-package
similar_to: E318
principles:
doc_file: DRAFT-libxdp-1.6.3-ohos-xdp-tests-unrunnable.md
source_event: libxdp 1.6.3 鸿蒙电脑真机：DID_UNSHARE=1 跑上游 runner 得 0 PASS / 8 环境阻塞 / 2 link-only
authors: staralsnow
